        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exciting journey through the most astonishing corners of the planet, where each new day brings fresh discoveries and vivid impressions. You’ll explore <strong>30 unique locations</strong>, designed to showcase the many facets of our incredible Earth: from majestic mountain ranges and endless desert sands to whispering forests and pristine national parks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218400/extras/e923053fe6d31cefcc73a06434713d95.poster.avif?t=1776253859\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218400/extras/e923053fe6d31cefcc73a06434713d95.webm?t=1776253859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218400/extras/e923053fe6d31cefcc73a06434713d95.mp4?t=1776253859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the spirit of true adventure — explore the world around you, participate in engaging mini-games, and sharpen your attention as you search for hidden objects among picturesque landscapes. Each task is a small step toward new knowledge, emotions, and discoveries that will accompany you throughout your entire journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218400/extras/f3ae4f6589f6d4d46a6346c5d68a9685.poster.avif?t=1776253859\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218400/extras/f3ae4f6589f6d4d46a6346c5d68a9685.webm?t=1776253859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218400/extras/f3ae4f6589f6d4d46a6346c5d68a9685.mp4?t=1776253859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Collector’s Edition includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten additional locations</strong> — even more places to feel like an explorer and discover new horizons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 bonus puzzles and 10 original mini-games</strong> that provide extra hours of captivating entertainment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant desktop screensavers</strong> with stunning views to keep a piece of your journey always close.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An exclusive music player</strong> that creates an atmosphere of distant travels, tranquility, and inspiration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world of adventure, beauty, and discovery — and allow yourself to see the Earth as you’ve never seen it before!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exciting journey through the most astonishing corners of the planet, where each new day brings fresh discoveries and vivid impressions. You’ll explore <strong>30 unique locations</strong>, designed to showcase the many facets of our incredible Earth: from majestic mountain ranges and endless desert sands to whispering forests and pristine national parks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218400/extras/e923053fe6d31cefcc73a06434713d95.poster.avif?t=1776253859\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218400/extras/e923053fe6d31cefcc73a06434713d95.webm?t=1776253859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218400/extras/e923053fe6d31cefcc73a06434713d95.mp4?t=1776253859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the spirit of true adventure — explore the world around you, participate in engaging mini-games, and sharpen your attention as you search for hidden objects among picturesque landscapes. Each task is a small step toward new knowledge, emotions, and discoveries that will accompany you throughout your entire journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218400/extras/f3ae4f6589f6d4d46a6346c5d68a9685.poster.avif?t=1776253859\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218400/extras/f3ae4f6589f6d4d46a6346c5d68a9685.webm?t=1776253859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218400/extras/f3ae4f6589f6d4d46a6346c5d68a9685.mp4?t=1776253859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Collector’s Edition includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten additional locations</strong> — even more places to feel like an explorer and discover new horizons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 bonus puzzles and 10 original mini-games</strong> that provide extra hours of captivating entertainment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant desktop screensavers</strong> with stunning views to keep a piece of your journey always close.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An exclusive music player</strong> that creates an atmosphere of distant travels, tranquility, and inspiration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world of adventure, beauty, and discovery — and allow yourself to see the Earth as you’ve never seen it before!</p>",
        "short_description": "An exciting journey through the most scenic places in the world: hidden objects, mini-games, puzzles, and countless discoveries. Feel the spirit of adventure and explore new horizons!",
